# Go Ninja Go, "Choose one or both" (CR 700.2): both modes. Mode 1 exiles Bot1's Memnite and returns it (a new object); mode 2 deals damage equal to the
# greatest power among Bot1's creatures (Memnite 1, Ornithopter 0, so 1) to Bot2's Coral Merfolk (2/1), which dies. Mode 1 only takes a creature Bot1
# controls and mode 2 only one an opponent controls.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Ornithopter
Go Ninja Go
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Coral Merfolk
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Coral Merfolk.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield = Coral Merfolk; Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Go Ninja Go.Cast
! Bot1.Modes(Count: 0)
Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
! Bot1.Target(Coral Merfolk)
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Coral Merfolk)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire
Bot2.Graveyard = Coral Merfolk
Bot1.Battlefield = Memnite; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Go Ninja Go
